<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>GlusterFS on 断念梦的站点</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/5.%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/GlusterFS/</link><description>Recent content in GlusterFS on 断念梦的站点</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/5.%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/GlusterFS/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>GlusterFS 的部署与使用</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/5.%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/GlusterFS/GlusterFS-%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/5.%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/GlusterFS/GlusterFS-%E7%9A%84%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E4%B8%8E%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="glusterfs-的部署与使用"&gt;GlusterFS 的部署与使用&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#glusterfs-%e7%9a%84%e9%83%a8%e7%bd%b2%e4%b8%8e%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;初始化 yum 源配置&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;yum install centos-release-gluster6 -y&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;分区、格式化、挂载使用 bricks 的磁盘&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assuming you have a brick at /dev/sdb:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fdisk /dev/sdb&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create a single partition on the brick that uses the whole capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;格式化分区&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;mkfs.xfs -i size=512 /dev/sdb&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;将分区挂载为 gluster 的 brick&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;mkdir -p /data/brick1 &amp;amp;&amp;amp; mount /dev/sdb /data/brick1 &amp;amp;&amp;amp; mkdir -p /data/brick1brick&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在/etc/fstab 文件中添加条目使得目录自动挂载&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;echo &amp;ldquo;/dev/sdb /data/brick1 xfs defaults 0 0&amp;rdquo; &amp;raquo; /etc/fstab&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在所有节点安装 glusterfs 所用的包&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;yum install glusterfs{,-server,-fuse,-geo-replication,-client} -y&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>故障恢复测试</title><link>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/5.%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/GlusterFS/%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://desistdaydream.github.io/docs/5.%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84/%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%BC%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8/GlusterFS/%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="故障恢复测试"&gt;故障恢复测试&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#%e6%95%85%e9%9a%9c%e6%81%a2%e5%a4%8d%e6%b5%8b%e8%af%95" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
